# Trivy ignore list — every entry needs a reason and an expiry (exp:), so a
# suppression can never outlive the condition that justified it. After the
# expiry date the finding fails the ci.yml gate again.

# DLA-4792-1 — tzdata 2026b → 2026c in gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot.
# A timezone-database refresh, not a security flaw (Trivy: UNKNOWN). Not
# exploitable here: the service never loads a zone (no time.LoadLocation, no
# time/tzdata; all timestamps are UTC). Blocked upstream: on 2026-09-28 the
# :nonroot tag still resolved to the pinned digest (`make pin-base-images`
# was a no-op). Remove this entry and re-pin once distroless ships 2026c.
DLA-4792-1 exp:2026-10-31

# DLA-4845-1 — ca-certificates 20250419~deb12u1 → deb12u2 in
# gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot (removes the distrusted Comodo
# "AAA Certificate Services" and "emSign ECC Root CA - G3" roots). Not
# exploitable here: the Dockerfile copies the builder's patched deb12u2 bundle
# over distroless's /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt, which is the file the
# Go binaries trust; Trivy still reports it only because it reads distroless's
# dpkg metadata. Blocked upstream: on 2026-10-21 the pinned digest was still
# the latest :nonroot. Remove this entry, the Dockerfile COPY, and re-pin once
# distroless ships deb12u2. Same fix as iam-realm-provisioner commit 6bd23df.
DLA-4845-1 exp:2026-11-21
